OL,3,GNEWSACar meet concern prompts police
OL,4,Adispersal order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been issued
OL,7,Fcovering an industrial estate after
OL,8,F"concerns about a proposed car meet".
OL,10,FSurrey Police said the order would take
OL,11,Feffect from 18:00 GMT on Friday and
OL,12,Fencompasses Brooklands Industrial
OL,13,FEstate in Weybridge and its
OL,14,Fsurroundings.
OL,16,FThe order grants police powers to
OL,17,Fdirect people to leave the area if they
OL,18,Fhave, or are likely to, be a nuisance,
OL,19,Fcommit a crime or cause disorder.
OL,21,FIt is set to remain in place until
OL,22,F07:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
